Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator, wamerican
Description: OS-wide AI text proofreader for GNOME/Wayland
 Select text in any application, press a global hotkey, and have it
 proofread by an LLM (local Ollama by default; OpenAI-compatible,
 Anthropic and Google Gemini APIs supported) and replaced in place.
 .
 Ships a tray-icon daemon with GNOME global hotkeys, desktop
 notifications, a GTK4/libadwaita settings app, and autostart on login.
